    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "I am already using that.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfor _ in range(0, M, block_size):\r\n        x = tl.load(X_block_ptr, boundary_check=(0, 1), padding_option=\"zero\")\r\n        s = tl.sum(x, axis=0)\r\n        s = tl.sum(s, axis=0)\r\n        acc += s\r\n        tl.advance(X_block_ptr, (block_size, 0))\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2023-08-21T17:04:18Z",
